---
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Brandt Elektrotechnik — Demo</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" />

<style is:inline>
  :root {
    --navy: #0f2942; --navy-2: #0b1f33; --steel: #2f6fb3; --steel-d: #245a94;
    --ink: #17222e; --muted: #5a6b7a; --paper: #ffffff; --wash: #f3f6fa; --line: #e2e8f0;
    --font: "Archivo", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font); color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); line-height: 1.6; padding-top: 2.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  img { max-width: 100%; }

  .demobar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 999; height: 2.5rem; background: #08080A; color: #D9B45B; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 0 1rem; font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .demobar b { color: #F7E7B6; }
  .demobar a { border-bottom: 1px solid #D9B45B; padding-bottom: 1px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .demobar span:last-child { display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .demobar { font-size: 0.58rem; } .demobar b { display: none; } }

  .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3rem); }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: var(--steel); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--steel-d); }
  .btn--ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--navy); border: 1px solid var(--line); }

  header.site { background: var(--navy); color: #fff; }
  header.site .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-block: 1.1rem; }
  .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .logo::before { content: "⚡"; color: var(--steel); }
  header.site nav { display: flex; gap: 1.8rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #c9d6e3; }
  header.site nav a:hover { color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { header.site nav { display: none; } }

  .hero { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy), var(--navy-2)); color: #fff; }
  .hero .wrap { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem); }
  .hero .eyebrow { font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--steel); font-weight: 600; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 1rem 0 0; max-width: 16ch; }
  .hero p { color: #b9c7d6; max-width: 46ch; margin: 1.2rem 0 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .hero .cta { margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.9rem; }
  .hero .cta .btn--ghost { color: #fff; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }

  .section { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem); }
  .section h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 0.6rem; }
  .section .sub { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 2.5rem; }

  .services { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; }
  .svc { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.6rem; }
  .svc h3 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .svc p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.94rem; }
  .svc .ic { width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--wash); display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--steel); }
  .svc .ic svg { width: 1.35rem; height: 1.35rem; }
  @media (max-width: 780px) { .services { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .why { background: var(--wash); }
  .why ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem 2rem; }
  .why li { display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; }
  .why li::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--steel); font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .why ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .contact .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .contact .card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.8rem; }
  .contact dl { margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0.5rem 1.2rem; }
  .contact dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .contact dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 500; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .contact .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  footer.site { background: var(--navy); color: #92a4b6; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  footer.site .wrap { padding-block: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem 1.5rem; justify-content: space-between; }
</style>

<div class="demobar">
  <span>DEMO · So könnte die Website für einen <b>Handwerksbetrieb</b> aussehen</span>
  <span>
    <a href="/beispiele">← Galerie</a>
    <a href="/#kontakt">Diese Website für meinen Betrieb →</a>
  </span>
</div>

<header class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo">Brandt Elektrotechnik</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#leistungen">Leistungen</a>
      <a href="#warum">Warum wir</a>
      <a href="#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn" href="/kalender">Termin anfragen</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Meisterbetrieb · Elektro · Sanitär · Heizung</div>
    <h1>Wenn's zuverlässig sein muss.</h1>
    <p>Seit 1996 für Privat und Gewerbe in Musterstadt und Umgebung. Feste Termine, saubere Arbeit, klare Preise.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href="/kalender">Termin online anfragen</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#leistungen">Leistungen ansehen</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="leistungen">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Unsere Leistungen</h2>
    <p class="sub">Ein Ansprechpartner für Elektrik, Sanitär und Heizung.</p>
    <div class="services">
      <div class="svc"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3>Elektroinstallation</h3><p>Neubau, Sanierung, Zählerschrank, Smart Home, E-Check und Reparaturen.</p></div>
      <div class="svc"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5S12 3 12 2c0 1-2 3.9-4 5.5S5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"></path></svg></div><h3>Sanitär &amp; Bad</h3><p>Badsanierung, Leckortung, Armaturen, barrierefreier Umbau.</p></div>
      <div class="svc"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z"></path></svg></div><h3>Heizung</h3><p>Wartung, Störungsdienst, Heizungstausch und Wärmepumpe.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section why" id="warum">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Warum Brandt</h2>
    <p class="sub">Handwerk, auf das man sich verlassen kann.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Meistergeführt seit 1996</li>
      <li>Termine, die auch gehalten werden</li>
      <li>Festpreis vor Auftragsbeginn</li>
      <li>24-Stunden-Notdienst</li>
      <li>Eigene Monteure, keine Subunternehmer</li>
      <li>Gewährleistung auf alle Arbeiten</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact" id="kontakt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Kontakt &amp; Anfahrt</h2>
    <p class="sub">Rufen Sie an oder fragen Sie einen Termin online an.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <dl>
          <dt>Adresse</dt><dd>Musterstraße 12, 12345 Musterstadt</dd>
          <dt>Telefon</dt><dd>01234 / 56 78 90</dd>
          <dt>E-Mail</dt><dd>info@brandt-elektro.demo</dd>
          <dt>Zeiten</dt><dd>Mo–Fr 7–17 Uhr · Notdienst 24/7</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Termin online anfragen</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted)">Wählen Sie einen freien Termin – wir bestätigen innerhalb eines Werktags.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/kalender">Zum Terminkalender</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>© <span id="y"></span> Brandt Elektrotechnik · Musterstadt · <a href="/beispiele" style="border-bottom:1px solid currentColor">Demo von EAN Agency</a></span>
    <span>Impressum · Datenschutz</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<script is:inline>document.getElementById("y").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>

<script is:inline>if("scrollRestoration" in history)history.scrollRestoration="manual";if(!location.hash)window.scrollTo(0,0);window.addEventListener("pageshow",function(){if(!location.hash)window.scrollTo(0,0);});</script>
